      "v": 23,
      "zh": "也不再因偶像和可憎的物，并一切的罪过玷污自己。我却要救他们出离一切的住处，就是他们犯罪的地方；我要洁净他们，如此，他们要作我的子民，我要作他们的　神。",
      "en": "They will not defile themselves with their idols, their detestable things, and all their rebellious deeds. I will save them from all their unfaithfulness[NOTE:1] by which they sinned. I will purify them; they will become my people, and I will become their God.",
      "notes": [
